// Re-recorded for checksum schema 29 (plan 2026-11-10-spellcaster-mechanics D-12, D-13 item 2),
// which no longer encodes the hazard zones, the next hazard id or each unit's last storm damage
// tick; every checkpoint changed from checkpoint 1 and no behaviour did. Traced tick by tick against
// schema 28 (5a79962): Debug dumps of every entity, projectile, player's resources, the effect state
// and the render snapshot after every tick are byte-identical once the removed field's lines are
